{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 521, "text": "给刘策成的信\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n策成( l ] 先生：\n惠书敬悉，甚为感谢。\n先生欲为人民事业有所贡献，极为钦佩。地点似以在长沙\n为宜，那里熟习先生的人较多，商筹较为便利，\n尚祈斟酌。顺\n致敬意\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 策成，即刘策成，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时\n的历史教师，庄子研究专家。\n492 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "6eba6ad83ad6757000c07fe963079989dcfd9d25dc237c49f1b7912d0ed6ab42", "text_chars": 180}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 522, "text": "给俏晓初的信\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n晓初C 1 ] 先生：\n来信收到，甚为感谢。泽覃[ 2 ] 已殉难，他是一九三五年\n在江西被国民党杀死的，知注并闻。顺致\n敬意\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n/\n注\n释\nC 1 J 晓初，\n即詹晓初，\n当时在湖南益阳居住。\nC 2 J 泽覃，\n即毛泽覃，毛泽东的二弟。一九二三年十月加入中\n国共产党。\n曾任永（丰）吉（安）泰（和）\n中心特委书记、\n中共苏\n区中央局秘书长、\n中央苏区独立师师长。一九三五年四月在江西瑞\n金作战时牺牲。\n493 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "7582a2c520876072d85d1ddd2d24e9e6fefb824671874f71c4c8e7933e94eaf1", "text_chars": 250}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 523, "text": "给张汉雄的信\n，（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n汉雄( 1 ] 先生：\n来信收到，甚谢。弟自离湘以后，\n即未见过彭平之( 2 J 兄，\n迄不知其情况，只知其业已殉难。此复，顺致\n敬意\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 汉雄，即张汉雄，\n当时在湖南南岳居住。\nC 2 J 彭平之，新民学会会员，湖南社会主义青年团早期团员。\n494 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "23ae274666c2839b0dcc0fe4fca8a431e1f55c0e259522a0158598609a59f73f", "text_chars": 179}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 524, "text": "4' • \n4 4 \n给张恕的信\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n张恕C 1 ] 先生：\n来信读悉。生活困难，极为同情。工作问题，\n以就近向各\n机关学校中熟悉先生情况的友人筹谋解决，较为适宜。此复，\n顺祝健进\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 张恕，毛泽东在湖南省立第一师范学校读书时的同学。\n495 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "d507aad23a0250037883aa9438da782f35350cd6c2603b9c86469fde4ef4613f", "text_chars": 165}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 525, "text": "给廖振华的信\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n振华C 1 J 兄：\n来信收到，甚为感谢。吾兄既已在当地为人民服务，似不\n必远道来京，\n尚望斟酌。此复，顺致\n敬意\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 振华，即廖振华，\n当时在湖南衡山居住。\n、·\n496 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9f2e1327bbdf220df9ac01f24d1f1068a0aaa6a5d2c194db11d57d2a627b8cc9", "text_chars": 139}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 526, "text": "给周毅胜的信\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n毅胜（l 侗志：\n来信收到，感谢你的好意。\n学习或调动工作问题，\n我不便提出意见，\n如果你现在工作\n的机关允许你这样做，\n我是赞成的。此复，顺祝\n进步\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月二十九日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 毅胜，即周毅胜，\n当时在中国人民解放军西北军区卫生部\n工作。延安时期曾任枣园卫生所所长、\n医务主任兼毛泽东的保健\n医生。\n497 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "5c1d0ac9be34e09dd6edc521a89d1d57c799d629d4f0cbd4442f91e69ab95360", "text_chars": 195}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 527, "text": "祝贺越南独立五周年的电报\n（一九五0 年八月二十九日）\n越南民主共和国政府胡志明主席阁下：\n欣逢越南独立五周年纪念，我谨代表中华人民共和国中央\n人民政府及中国人民向阁下及越南人民致热烈的庆贺，并祝越\n南人民在反对帝国主义争取民族解放斗争中获得完全的胜利，\n在建设独立民主的越南的事业上获得更大的成功。\n498 \n中华人民共和国\n中央人民政府主席\n毛泽东\n一九五0 年八月二十九日于北京\n根据一九五0年九月二日\n《人民日报》刊印。\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "2b8da19fbacf566bf41767108e9f1644048afd1fd9ac09f2720d14069948b7b6", "text_chars": 215}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 528, "text": "给词脏瑛的信\n（一九五0 年八月三十一日）\n世瑛( 1 ] 学兄：\n五月来信收读，又承赠以长歌，深感厚意。生活困难，极\n为同情。现在到人民政府所属机构做事，或到学校教书，薪入\n甚微，对于家口众多者不易赡给；又须入相当学校学些马克思\n主义观点，\n方能齐一步调，有共同作风。\n以吾兄状况观之，能\n就近获得工作职位，为最好；否则须远出参加短期研究班的学\n习，须准备吃很大的苦楚，\n又难于赡家，\n未知有此决心否？\n顺致敬意\n毛\n泽\n东\n八月三十一日\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 J 世瑛，\n即谭世瑛，毛泽东在湖南湘乡县立东山高等小学堂\n读书时的同学，毛泽东的国文教师谭咏春的儿子。\n499 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "9e0dbedb20f81bfba548109720480f304153a2a9f293bdf1db7dae8d4e3fbdad", "text_chars": 294}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 529, "text": "为第一届全国卫生会议题词(1]\n（一九五0 年八月）\n团结新老中西各部分医药卫生工作人员，组成巩固的统一\n战线，为开展伟大的人民卫生工作而奋斗！\n毛\n泽\n东\n根据手稿刊印。\n注\n释\nC 1 ] 第一届全国卫生会议于一九五0年八月七日至十九日在北\n京举行。\n500 \n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a1f47716795a11c92e56", "source_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/M0rtzz/Selected-Works-of-MaoTseTung/4cc981c232e1ffe8fe2974e125c00af8376829ca/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF/%E5%BB%BA%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A5%E6%9D%A5%E6%AF%9B%E6%B3%BD%E4%B8%9C%E6%96%87%E7%A8%BF_%E7%AC%AC2%E5%86%8C%EF%BC%881950%E5%B9%B43%E6%9C%88-1950%E5%B9%B48%E6%9C%88%EF%BC%89.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "d7c1d1b00533f31687a1d084bed84207ccec7a029895eb3219d0e2b407fa1fc9", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "wengao-2023-20", "volume": 2, "basis": "mirror_folder_and_filename_pending_book_imprint_check"}], "source_text_sha256": "bc71f8e95a587a54ebe2ac7827a052d37b75cd0f9802470ea7c67bb424f3bbad", "text_chars": 133}
